		"/detect_objects": {
			"post": {
				"summary": "Detect Objects",
				"description": "Detect objects in an image, image sequence or video. The behavior of the detection process is controlled by the `class_selection_mode` parameter: `all` (detects all objects, including those from the pre-trained COCO classes), `without pre-trained` (excludes pretraind classes entirely from detection), `pre-trained-filtered` (improves detection precision compared to the `without pre-trained` option by removing results related to pretrained classes after the detection process is complete).",
